>> title: Buttermilk Waffles
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: breakfast, buttermilk, waffle iron, batter
>> servings: 6
>> time: 40 min

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2%cup}(260 g), @sugar{2%Tbsp}(25 g), @baking powder{1 1/2%tsp}(6 g), @baking soda{1/2%tsp}(3 g), and @fine sea salt{3/4%tsp}(4 g).

Beat @buttermilk{2%cup}(480 mL), @egg yolks{2%large}(35 g), @melted unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g), and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Stir @&(~2)dry mixture{}, @&(~1)wet mixture{} together just until smooth.

Whip @egg whites{2%large}(70 g), @cream of tartar{1/8%tsp} to soft peaks.

Fold @&(~1)whipped whites{} into @&(~2)batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} in a hot #waffle iron{} ~{4%min}, until the steam stops.
